# Example: context parent field path

Engine is a : context child of Car, so it has theCar.

## Schema

```
Car = :Engine String/model
Engine = Int/cylinders
```

## Construction

```
[:Car
  [:Engine 4]
  "Toyota"
]
```

## Methods

```
Engine::carModel = { theCar.model }
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var assemblage = carFactory();
    var helper = new WCHNTHelper();
    trace(assemblage.toConstruction(0, helper));
}
```
